  "title": "tap-rlcltestat: add finish routine",
  "description": "Add a finish function to the call of `register_tap_listener()` which\nfrees the memory allocated by the tap. This includes the tap data\nallocated upon registration, as well as the list of UE rows.\n\nAdd code to the reset function which frees the memory allocated for UE\nrows, instead of simply leaking them by resetting the list pointer to\n`NULL`.\n\nPing #20432",
